UID:kickstarter-culture-fund-2026@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260902T210037Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261231
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270101
SUMMARY:Deadline: Kickstarter Culture Fund
DESCRIPTION:Kickstarter's USD 1\,000\,000 Culture Fund supports independent
  creators in Art\, Photography\, Dance\, Theater\, Film\, Fashion and Musi
 c by pledging money directly into their Kickstarter campaigns. Every award
 ed project receives at least USD 1\,000\, with amounts above that set by t
 he Kickstarter team based on each campaign's needs. NOTE: this is not a st
 andalone grant\; you must have a draft or live Kickstarter campaign (at mi
 nimum a main image and description) and actually launch it by 31 December 
 2026\, and the pledge is applied once the project is live\, so standard Ki
 ckstarter mechanics (all-or-nothing funding\, platform fees on funds raise
 d) apply. ELIGIBILITY: creators 18+ in Kickstarter's 25+ supported countri
 es. Selection criteria are innovation\, design\, creative story\, Kickstar
 ter potential and demonstrated ability to execute. Applications are review
 ed on a rolling basis throughout 2026 with responses within six weeks\; no
  application fee.\n\nOrganisation: Kickstarter\nLocation: 25+ eligible cou
 ntries (US\, UK\, Canada\, Australia\, most of Europe including the Nether
 lands)\nAward: USD 1\,000\,000 total fund\; every awarded project receives
  at least USD 1\,000\, with larger amounts at Kickstarter's discretion bas
 ed on campaign needs\nDuration: Rolling review throughout 2026\, responses
  within six weeks\; funded campaigns must launch by 31 December 2026\n\nMo
 re: https://landing.kickstarter.com/culture-fund?utm_source=artificialnouv
 eaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://landing.kickstarter.com/culture-fund?utm_source=artificialnouve
 augrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:25+ eligible countries (US\, UK\, Canada\, Australia\, most of Eur
 ope including the Netherlands)
END:VEVENT
